### Page 1 of 7

```text
MEMO

TO:

Mayor Orr, City Council

FROM:
Charles W. Bloom, Planning & Development Director

SUBJECT:
Unified Development Code (UDC) required reporting of park fees

DATE:
August 6, 2019

The attached report is required to be submitted to City Council pursuant to Section 4.2.5 of the
UDC (Park Fees). The relevant excerpt of that Section reads as follows:

f.
Public Reporting and Accountability.  The City shall each year report the source and
disbursement of the fees as follows:

1. At the third regularly scheduled City Council meeting after the end of each fiscal year, a
written report shall be presented to the City Council on the fees with the following
information:

(a) Source of all fees by person, subdivision/development name and amount collected;
(b) Disbursement of any fees to whom and by project or item(s) and the amount of
purchase; and
(c) Balance in the fee accounts as of June 30th of each year

2. The Treasurer of the City shall maintain a specific account for all fees independent of
from all other general fund accounts of the City. This account shall be represented and
budgeted in the annual budget reporting of the City.

Please give me a call if you have questions.  Thank you.

encl:
Summary report

cc:
City Clerk

City Attorney

A COMMUNITY OF CHOICE

PLANNING AND DEVELOPMENT DEPARTMENT
2101 O’Neil Avenue, Room 202, Cheyenne, Wyoming 82001
307.637.6310 lpafford@cheyennecity.org 307.637.6366 (Fax)
```

